      en: ["Timna Park covers an area of 60 square kilometers (23 square miles).", "The copper mines date back over 6,000 years.", "Solomon's Pillars rise up to 50 meters (164 ft) in height.", "The park is located 25 km (15.5 miles) north of Eilat.", "The annual average temperature is 25°C (77°F).", "Over 150,000 tourists visit the park each year."],
